  "details": "Description\n\nwhenever I open vrchat again, the icon gets reset but the photo isnt deleted, just kinda annoying to edit profile and go to change the icon every time. could be related to my steam thinking vrc is still running after i've closed it.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nchange icon(without vrc+) to a ingame camera photo, close and re open vrchat, try setting res to 4k on camera\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
